#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:4
msgid "Docker deployment"
msgstr "Docker 部署"

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:7
msgid "Running the container image"
msgstr "运行容器镜像"

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:9
msgid ""
"You can run the LMCache integrated with vLLM image using Docker as "
"follows:"
msgstr "您可以使用 Docker 运行集成了 vLLM 的 LMCache 镜像，方法如下："

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:26
msgid ""
"The image name and tag can be found on DockerHub - `LMCache/vllm-openai "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/lmcache/vllm-openai>`_. See example run file in"
" `docker <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_ for more "
"details."
msgstr "镜像名称和标签可以在 DockerHub 上找到 - `LMCache/vllm-openai <https://hub.docker.com/r/lmcache/vllm-openai>`_。有关更多详细信息，请参阅 `docker <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_ 中的示例运行文件。"

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:31
msgid "DockerHub contains the following image types:"
msgstr "DockerHub 包含以下镜像类型："

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:33
msgid ""
"Nightly build images of LMCache and vLLM latest code (e.g. tagged with "
"`latest-nightly` and `nightly-<date>`)"
msgstr "LMCache 和 vLLM 最新代码的每日构建镜像（例如标记为 `latest-nightly` 和 `nightly-<date>`）"

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:34
msgid ""
"Images of stable releases of LMCache and vLLM (tagged with `v0.x.x`, the "
"exact version of vllm a version of lmcache was built with can be "
"discovered by consulting the compatibility matrix inside of `installation"
" <../installation.rst>`_)"
msgstr "LMCache 和 vLLM 稳定版本的镜像（标记为 `v0.x.x`，可以通过查看 `installation <../installation.rst>`_ 中的兼容性矩阵来发现 lmcache 版本构建时使用的确切 vllm 版本）"

#: ../../source/production/docker_deployment.rst:36
msgid ""
"Lightweight image that cannot run PD disaggregation (tagged with "
"`lightweight`)"
msgstr "无法运行 PD 分离的轻量级镜像（标记为 `lightweight`）"

